[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15601.67, "timestamp": "04:20:01", "text": "无处可逃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15607.11, "timestamp": "04:20:07", "text": "哎哟。上帝。为什么啊？我要死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15619.75, "timestamp": "04:20:19", "text": "我真不知道那是什么凤凰"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15635.83, "timestamp": "04:20:35", "text": "兄弟。哦，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15637.67, "timestamp": "04:20:37", "text": "没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15640.309, "timestamp": "04:20:40", "text": "我只想消灭霓虹灯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15643.469, "timestamp": "04:20:43", "text": "这也是你今天的第一场比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15645.87, "timestamp": "04:20:45", "text": "啊，在那儿。求求你，求求你，求求你。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15652.309, "timestamp": "04:20:52", "text": "不。是的，我们赢了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15657.11, "timestamp": "04:20:57", "text": "聊天中提到霓虹灯之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15659.11, "timestamp": "04:20:59", "text": "再见各位。你做得很好。你是"}]